WEBVTT

00:15.100 --> 00:22.130
I'll never be easily loved...

00:22.270 --> 00:29.370
Am I just too clumsy?

00:29.980 --> 00:36.580
That girl who looks good in pink...

00:37.150 --> 00:43.280
Is that who you want?

00:43.920 --> 00:47.920
Is red not good enough?

00:48.030 --> 00:54.870
The rabbit with red eyes runs away.

00:55.040 --> 01:02.270
Even though I loved you so much...

01:02.410 --> 01:10.410
If I'm sad, I'm going to die.

01:10.550 --> 01:17.420
The rabbit that you like...

01:17.720 --> 01:24.790
...isn't on the moon.
It's just a rabbit...

02:01.130 --> 02:02.530
Murderer.

02:05.540 --> 02:06.510
Sinner

02:06.910 --> 02:08.430
Two years ago...

02:08.710 --> 02:10.800
A massacre, you say?

02:10.980 --> 02:14.240
Sinners or not,
what a merciless thing to do...

02:14.310 --> 02:15.440
Sinners?

02:15.620 --> 02:16.980
Gimme a break.

02:17.120 --> 02:18.910
Were they not?

02:19.020 --> 02:22.010
Not a single one
of them was a sinner.

02:22.120 --> 02:26.990
I kept on killing even those
who didn't need to be killed.

02:27.560 --> 02:31.000
I believed they were
scoundrels going against my lord.

02:31.230 --> 02:35.070
But the real villain was my master.

02:36.270 --> 02:39.360
He fooled me... but not just that...

02:40.170 --> 02:45.110
I also got caught up in swinging
my sword around like I was the best.

02:45.380 --> 02:49.540
Now that I think about it, my own
stupidity makes me want to vomit.

02:49.650 --> 02:52.580
So then what happened?

02:58.190 --> 03:00.250
Not just my master Horii...

03:00.560 --> 03:04.430
Policemen, detectives,
and bounty hunters...

03:05.000 --> 03:07.400
Anyone who tried to catch me...

03:08.940 --> 03:10.330
I killed them all.

03:10.440 --> 03:12.410
By any chance, are you...

03:13.310 --> 03:14.900
I knew it.

03:15.380 --> 03:18.640
Manji the Hundred-man Slayer,
I presume?

03:19.010 --> 03:19.880
Yeah.

03:19.950 --> 03:22.640
The sin of taking a hundred lives...

03:22.750 --> 03:25.910
Atoning for such a thing
may not be so easy.

03:26.520 --> 03:30.220
Why don't we consult God?

03:30.360 --> 03:31.480
Please do.

03:33.130 --> 03:36.120
I have received a grim answer.

03:36.500 --> 03:39.830
He says the only
sufficient penance is death.

03:40.530 --> 03:42.590
I wish it was that easy...

03:51.240 --> 03:53.940
Is that it? It's over?

03:56.080 --> 04:00.020
From now on,
the strongest man in Japan...

04:00.620 --> 04:02.280
...is me?

04:03.120 --> 04:04.610
Little ol' me?

04:09.960 --> 04:13.190
Let's put an end to this, all right?

04:18.510 --> 04:20.440
I don't really want to kill.

04:44.500 --> 04:47.360
There's no God or Buddha, huh...

04:47.470 --> 04:52.340
Kurose
Head of the House of Asano

05:27.040 --> 05:29.570
Anotsu Kagehisa...

05:32.980 --> 05:36.070
What do you want from the ltto-ryu?

05:36.580 --> 05:40.180
I would like you
and your ltto-ryu swordsmen...

05:40.290 --> 05:43.850
...to join my
Kouken Dojo as instructors.

05:45.430 --> 05:47.520
I'm honored by the offer...

05:47.690 --> 05:50.490
...but I wonder
if we're fit for the position.

05:52.030 --> 05:56.990
After all, we are nothing but a band
of incompetent failed swordsmen.

05:57.770 --> 06:02.710
Even if we became instructors,
would the samurai these days...

06:03.910 --> 06:05.780
...be able to handle it?

06:06.410 --> 06:08.280
Please do not worry.

06:08.380 --> 06:13.650
Better for them to know
how powerless they are.

06:21.760 --> 06:24.460
I have something I would like to ask.

06:25.470 --> 06:26.960
Anything.

06:27.230 --> 06:31.800
Master Habaki, what are your thoughts
regarding one person killing another?

06:36.480 --> 06:41.810
"Weep... Weep over
one's own destiny."

06:53.160 --> 06:54.990
Big Brother!

07:01.670 --> 07:03.570
Manji!

07:09.080 --> 07:11.600
What a cute little sister.

07:13.210 --> 07:15.700
Long time no see, Manji.

07:16.780 --> 07:18.050
Old lady!

07:18.480 --> 07:24.150
If memory serves me, there should
be a hidden shrine past here.

07:24.460 --> 07:29.490
So you tried to find a road to salvation
through a foreign god, eh?

07:31.030 --> 07:33.020
Who's asking to be saved?

07:34.700 --> 07:37.500
Oh, was my guess wrong?

07:38.470 --> 07:40.910
When I met you for the first time...

07:41.010 --> 07:45.600
...your eyes
looked hungry for salvation.

07:47.610 --> 07:49.880
There's something I want to know.

07:50.520 --> 07:55.510
Why did you put those worms in me?

07:59.760 --> 08:03.860
How long do I have
to live on in this body?

08:07.270 --> 08:10.360
My body is full of bloodworms too.

08:11.100 --> 08:12.200
What!

08:12.770 --> 08:16.670
Thanks to them,
I've lived over 800 years.

08:18.280 --> 08:21.080
That's why I have
the name "Yaobikuni."

08:38.930 --> 08:41.330
Machi is 23 this year.

08:42.640 --> 08:46.130
I used to think the best
atonement a samurai could have...

08:46.710 --> 08:52.040
...was hara-kiri, but it's surprisingly
become more of an inconvenience.

08:53.850 --> 08:59.250
If I commit suicide, she would die
alone, insane, in a ditch somewhere.

08:59.390 --> 09:06.020
Manji, if you truly wish to be saved,
then first give up the sword.

09:06.830 --> 09:11.460
That offers more than
a confession or seppuku.

09:52.610 --> 09:54.300
Manji.

09:55.510 --> 09:56.440
What's up?

09:56.540 --> 09:59.840
I found a bean cake right over there.

10:00.180 --> 10:01.810
Want to eat it?

10:03.280 --> 10:06.450
Machi, that's horse shit.

10:07.520 --> 10:09.010
Horse shit?

10:09.490 --> 10:11.460
Wash your hands and go to bed.

10:11.560 --> 10:14.960
Okay, I'll wash
my hands and go to sleep.

10:42.690 --> 10:44.180
Infinity.

10:44.790 --> 10:46.190
Infinity.

10:49.160 --> 10:50.430
The hatamoto killer?

10:50.430 --> 10:51.690
The hatamoto killer?
There's a bounty...

10:51.800 --> 10:54.670
Idiot! Just find him and kill him!

10:58.840 --> 11:03.240
Machi, strolling along the streets
at night on your shoulder is pleasant...

11:03.340 --> 11:05.040
...but let's stop now.

11:05.140 --> 11:06.630
What are you saying?

11:07.280 --> 11:09.210
Even briefly, a samurai...

11:09.320 --> 11:12.410
...shouldn't lean on a woman's
shoulder, even his wife's ...

11:12.820 --> 11:17.090
Or you can't face the others?
You won't be able to anyway.

11:17.690 --> 11:21.960
You already fell over with
a stomachache in front of so many...

11:23.460 --> 11:26.430
Now I know how Goi in Imogayu felt.

11:26.530 --> 11:29.830
But what kind of dinner
party doesn't serve alcohol?

11:30.440 --> 11:31.670
Why don't we have a drink...

11:31.670 --> 11:32.660
Why don't we have a drink...
He ran!

11:33.140 --> 11:34.470
After him!

11:41.250 --> 11:44.770
Machi, it seems
I've got a little work to do.

11:44.880 --> 11:48.120
Go on ahead and warm up the sake.

11:48.550 --> 11:50.820
Could it be him...

11:51.460 --> 11:54.050
Also, get the bath nice and hot...

12:24.020 --> 12:27.520
I guess not every
kengo is careful...

12:27.930 --> 12:32.230
I am a police officer of the Katsukawa
house, Saito Oi Tatsumasa.

12:33.970 --> 12:38.300
No need to tell me your name,
as your life will soon be over.

12:38.910 --> 12:40.500
Is that so?

12:40.640 --> 12:42.400
I've heard about you.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.780
They say it was you...

12:44.880 --> 12:48.810
...who killed the hatamoto
Horii Shigenobu two years ago.

12:49.280 --> 12:51.840
I'm aware of what Lord Horii did.

12:51.980 --> 12:54.710
And I somewhat
understand how you feel.

12:54.850 --> 12:59.810
However, why didn't you commit
hara-kiri after you killed your lord?

13:00.530 --> 13:01.720
Cut the crap!

13:02.030 --> 13:05.430
Would you die for a man like that?

13:05.900 --> 13:08.530
Is that the duty of a samurai?

13:08.670 --> 13:13.040
Two years ago, exactly
five days after the incident.

13:13.140 --> 13:16.840
Two bodyguards took responsibility
and committed oibara.

13:16.940 --> 13:20.710
One was named
Saito Kazusanokami Tatsuie...

13:21.550 --> 13:22.610
My father!

13:24.580 --> 13:26.810
He was a true samurai.

13:27.120 --> 13:29.990
Not only did you not commit hara-kiri...

13:30.090 --> 13:34.220
...but you continue
to commit meaningless murders!

13:35.030 --> 13:38.960
For my father's honor and the lives
of your other 99 pursuers...

13:39.070 --> 13:43.060
I think I have ample reason to kill you!

13:56.250 --> 13:58.770
I've realized something about you.

13:58.880 --> 14:02.650
The true reason
you didn't commit hara-kiri...

14:04.060 --> 14:07.920
There are two paths
for those who bear swords.

14:08.330 --> 14:11.890
If they are walking the way
of the sword, they are a samurai.

14:12.700 --> 14:16.730
If they are walking the way
of bloodshed, then they are...

14:17.440 --> 14:19.100
...just a murderer.

14:21.870 --> 14:23.400
Murderer...

14:24.080 --> 14:26.640
You are a bloodthirsty beast.

14:26.980 --> 14:31.280
Nothing but an animal with
a taste for murdering people.

14:31.720 --> 14:33.280
Shut up...

14:33.420 --> 14:35.440
How many more will you kill?

14:35.590 --> 14:36.680
Fifty?

14:36.790 --> 14:37.980
A hundred?

14:38.390 --> 14:43.920
Why not just kill
a thousand like the beast you are?

14:55.440 --> 14:57.170
Lord have mercy

15:01.550 --> 15:02.540
Brother?

15:15.560 --> 15:17.120
No!

15:26.010 --> 15:27.060
Machi.

15:27.670 --> 15:30.440
It's fine.
There's nothing to worry about.

15:31.310 --> 15:34.070
It was only a dream, just a dream.

15:47.830 --> 15:51.730
Machi, where did you run off to?

15:53.470 --> 15:56.830
We've been looking for you,
Manji the Hundred-man Slayer.

15:56.940 --> 15:58.560
Who the hell are you?

15:58.700 --> 16:03.660
We need you to come with us. The
one you're looking for is waiting too.

16:08.980 --> 16:10.810
Ah, it's Big Brother.

16:15.290 --> 16:17.310
That didn't take long.

16:18.020 --> 16:20.150
My name's Shido Hishiyasu.

16:20.260 --> 16:23.060
Second in command
of the invincible Shinsen-gumi.

16:23.260 --> 16:25.960
I don't give a damn about your name.

16:26.100 --> 16:28.000
Let Machi go.

16:28.130 --> 16:31.000
If you haven't
done anything, I'll let you go.

16:31.140 --> 16:32.870
You'll let us go?

16:33.240 --> 16:35.430
Thank you for the offer.

16:36.410 --> 16:37.740
How nice!

16:37.840 --> 16:39.830
Why don't we go, guys?

16:39.950 --> 16:41.570
Yeah, right, dumb ass.

16:41.680 --> 16:47.880
We're about to mourn my brother Johnny,
who you killed at the hidden shrine.

16:50.420 --> 16:53.190
Fight us one on one.

16:53.330 --> 16:54.380
Brother...

16:54.490 --> 16:58.400
If you beat all of us, all is forgotten.

16:59.270 --> 17:00.730
All right...

17:02.270 --> 17:05.030
No, wait...

17:05.370 --> 17:06.530
Huh?

17:07.410 --> 17:09.840
I don't want to draw my sword.

17:10.280 --> 17:13.540
Is there some other
way we can do this?

17:13.880 --> 17:16.680
Huh? What was that?

17:17.020 --> 17:19.920
You don't have a choice.

17:21.320 --> 17:22.810
I want to...

17:23.360 --> 17:28.620
...wash my hands of this
foul-smelling world we live in.

17:28.960 --> 17:31.660
If you don't want to fight,
then that's fine.

17:31.760 --> 17:34.790
We'll just have her play with us.

17:34.900 --> 17:36.160
That tickles!

17:36.540 --> 17:38.660
I'll fight you barehanded, all right?

17:38.770 --> 17:41.540
My sister isn't part
of this! Let her go now!

17:41.670 --> 17:43.610
Come again?

17:43.780 --> 17:50.550
Are you really Manji the Hundred-man
Slayer who fights with twelve blades?

17:51.220 --> 17:54.550
You bastard, get your filthy hands...

17:55.120 --> 17:58.390
Cut the bullshit! What the hell
do you mean, "barehanded" ?

17:58.490 --> 18:00.150
You call yourself a samurai?

18:00.260 --> 18:04.320
What am I gonna do with the 20 guys
I brought here to deal with you?

18:05.100 --> 18:07.620
Let them play tag or something.

18:07.770 --> 18:09.060
I'll just watch.

18:13.210 --> 18:14.430
Boss...

18:15.370 --> 18:17.270
Let the girl go.

18:17.380 --> 18:18.240
What?

18:18.340 --> 18:19.940
Just do it already!

18:24.550 --> 18:25.480
Machi.

18:28.020 --> 18:29.490
Big Brother!

18:29.960 --> 18:33.020
Manji, don't hate me.

18:33.130 --> 18:34.390
I warned you...

18:34.830 --> 18:36.990
...that I'd play with her.

18:53.250 --> 18:54.940
Big Brother...

18:55.350 --> 18:57.780
It's cold today...

18:57.880 --> 18:58.850
Yeah.

18:59.490 --> 19:02.610
Will you play with me tomorrow?

19:02.720 --> 19:07.390
Yeah, I will. So just go to sleep now.

19:09.060 --> 19:14.660
Okay, I'll go to sleep.
Good night, Big Broth...

19:28.210 --> 19:31.670
The little sister dies,
and the brother follows.

19:32.520 --> 19:35.850
In the next life,
you two can hang out together.

19:36.490 --> 19:38.550
It's all your fault!

19:38.720 --> 19:40.850
Are you satisfied...

19:41.360 --> 19:43.990
...with it all ending like this?

19:56.740 --> 20:00.040
You said you wanted
to fight one on one, right?

20:00.350 --> 20:03.750
Ah, well, um, not anymore...

20:04.320 --> 20:07.310
I'll show you
if I can kill a hundred men...

20:08.750 --> 20:11.250
...whether you like it or not.

20:12.830 --> 20:14.350
Watch closely.

20:23.070 --> 20:24.630
I missed it...

20:27.240 --> 20:28.330
Machi...

20:28.910 --> 20:33.340
I would've died here if I could,
but it's just not possible.

20:34.210 --> 20:36.370
Not with this body...

20:37.050 --> 20:39.310
So at the very least, as a gift...

20:39.920 --> 20:43.580
...l'll send all these punks
to hell to be your servants!

20:44.690 --> 20:47.060
Make them eat horse shit.

21:00.870 --> 21:02.310
It's all my fault...

21:03.010 --> 21:05.240
For your husband's death...

21:05.610 --> 21:07.880
For you losing your mind...

21:08.750 --> 21:10.980
Everything was my fault...

21:12.050 --> 21:18.350
And the funny thing is
you couldn't even hate me for it.

21:23.560 --> 21:26.360
This was the Hundred-man Slayer...

21:33.170 --> 21:38.170
"Weep... Weep over
one's own destiny," huh?

21:39.410 --> 21:42.040
You've never looked better.

21:42.150 --> 21:43.740
I've decided.

21:45.020 --> 21:47.490
As penance for my 100 kills...

21:47.590 --> 21:53.050
...l'm going to use my remaining
years to kill 1,000 evil men.

21:53.230 --> 21:54.420
How's that?

21:55.130 --> 21:59.530
Just be sure this is truly
what you think is right.

22:07.910 --> 22:09.130
Now then...

22:13.780 --> 22:15.040
Father...

22:15.810 --> 22:19.440
I swear I'll get vengeance...

22:25.620 --> 22:31.530
Sadly, I awakened...

22:31.630 --> 22:40.230
Overflowing reality is just...

22:40.310 --> 22:46.140
...more of the empty lies.

22:49.450 --> 22:59.080
To be honest, I have
to get ready for the next one.

22:59.190 --> 23:05.290
The morning slides
in from the window.

23:05.560 --> 23:12.870
Regardless of what
I see, I remember.

23:12.970 --> 23:16.240
I remember...

23:16.310 --> 23:22.680
The unchanging wind always...

23:22.780 --> 23:29.120
...just said this as it passed by...

23:29.190 --> 23:37.860
"What's needed for
this endless journey?"

23:50.010 --> 23:53.070
Where should I go?

23:55.210 --> 23:56.680
Infinite Preview

24:08.160 --> 24:09.650
Conquest
